{"id":"msg_m_ex_biscuit_01","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_biscuit","label":"Biscuit · Nikke"},"label":"1. Hey there, Trainer.","stage":null,"prev":null,"next":"msg_m_ex_biscuit_02","speakers":{"biscuit":"Biscuit"},"icons":{"biscuit":"si_c381_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_biscuit_01_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"biscuit","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_biscuit_01_1","text":"Hey there, Trainer.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_biscuit_01_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"biscuit","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_biscuit_01_2","text":"Biscuit, at your service!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_biscuit_01_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"biscuit","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_biscuit_01_3","text":"I'm responsible for","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_biscuit_01_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"biscuit","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_biscuit_01_4","text":"keeping a leash on all those cute puppies","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_biscuit_01_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"biscuit","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_biscuit_01_5","text":"in the Happy Zoo Squad.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_biscuit_01_6","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_biscuit_01_6","text":"Why did you call me \"Trainer\"?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_biscuit_01_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"biscuit","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_biscuit_01_7","text":"Oh, that?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_biscuit_01_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"biscuit","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_biscuit_01_8","text":"I was told that once we're all living under the same roof,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_biscuit_01_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"biscuit","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_biscuit_01_9","text":"you'll be taking care of our little stable of critters.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_biscuit_01_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"biscuit","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_biscuit_01_10","text":"I'd say that makes \"Trainer\" a fitting moniker for you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_biscuit_01_11","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_biscuit_01_11","text":"I suppose so.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_biscuit_01_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"biscuit","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_biscuit_01_12","text":"Hee hee.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_biscuit_01_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"biscuit","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_biscuit_01_13","text":"Actually, I was a little worried you wouldn't be so keen on me calling you that.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_biscuit_01_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"biscuit","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_biscuit_01_14","text":"I'm glad that you like it, hee hee!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_biscuit_01_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"biscuit","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_biscuit_01_15","text":"Now that introductions are out of the way, we can...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_biscuit_01_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"biscuit","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_biscuit_01_16","text":"Happily!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_biscuit_01_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"biscuit","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_biscuit_01_17","text":"U・ᴥ・U","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_biscuit_01_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"biscuit","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_biscuit_01_18","text":"Joyfully!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_biscuit_01_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"biscuit","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_biscuit_01_19","text":"U^ᴥ^U","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_biscuit_01_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"biscuit","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_biscuit_01_20","text":"And woof-woofily!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_biscuit_01_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"biscuit","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_biscuit_01_21","text":"U>ᴥ<U","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_biscuit_01_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"biscuit","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_biscuit_01_22","text":"... Spend time with the doggos!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_biscuit_01_23","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_biscuit_01_23","text":"... Woof-woofily?","jump":"m_ex_biscuit_01_25"},{"id":"m_ex_biscuit_01_24","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_biscuit_01_24","text":"Arf arf!","jump":"m_ex_biscuit_01_26"},{"id":"m_ex_biscuit_01_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"biscuit","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_biscuit_01_25","text":"Isn't it great? I came up with that term myself.","jump":"m_ex_biscuit_01_28"},{"id":"m_ex_biscuit_01_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"biscuit","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_biscuit_01_26","text":"!!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_biscuit_01_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"biscuit","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_biscuit_01_27","text":"That's the spirit!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_biscuit_01_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"biscuit","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_biscuit_01_28","text":"Hee hee hee.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_biscuit_01_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"biscuit","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_biscuit_01_29","text":"I'll see you next time, furry bois in tow.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_biscuit_01_30","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_biscuit_01_30","text":"See you around.","jump":null}],"chat":true}